# Platinum Emperion: "You can't pay any amount of life except 0" (CR 119.8). Before it arrives Bot1 pays Gitaxian Probe's {U/P} with
# 2 life (CR 107.4f), with no blue mana to pay it otherwise: 18 (the positive control). With Emperion out, the second Probe can't be
# cast that way and Bot1 has no blue mana, so it is not offered. Bot2's Tainted Remedy would turn Bot1's Healing Salve gain of 3
# into a loss of 3 (CR 614.1a), but a gain Bot1 can't have meets no replacement (CR 119.7), and the Emperion ruling: "effects that
# replace an event with having you ... lose life will end up replacing the event with nothing": Bot1 stays at 18.

